{"seq":3,"slug":"multiplatform-persistence","title":"跨平台持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-persistence","wordCount":678,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨平台持久化\">跨平台持久化</h1><p>移动应用的数据持久化——从简单的键值存储到结构化的关系数据库——是仅次于网络层的第二大共享价值点。2026 年的 KMP 生态已经提供了成熟的跨平台持久化方案：Room Multiplatform 将 Google 最受欢迎的 ORM 带到了 iOS 和桌面平台；DataStore Multiplatform 取代 SharedPreferences 成为跨平台键值/类型化配置的标准选择；SQLDelight 则为需要精细 SQL 控制的场景提供编译时验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>KMP 持久化层的设计遵循&quot;统一 API + 平台驱动&quot;的模式，与网络层的引擎策略一脉相承：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph commonMain&#10;        A[Repository 接口] --&gt; B[Room DAO / SQLDelight Queries]&#10;        A --&gt; C[DataStore Preferences]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 平台驱动&#10;        D[SQLite Android]&#10;        E[SQLite iOS via SQLiter]&#10;        F[SQLite JVM via JDBC]&#10;    end&#10;    B --&gt; D&#10;    B --&gt; E&#10;    B --&gt; F\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph commonMain\n        A[Repository 接口] --&gt; B[Room DAO / SQLDelight Queries]\n        A --&gt; C[DataStore Preferences]\n    end\n    subgraph 平台驱动\n        D[SQLite Android]\n        E[SQLite iOS via SQLiter]\n        F[SQLite JVM via JDBC]\n    end\n    B --&gt; D\n    B --&gt; E\n    B --&gt; F</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>KMP 成熟度</th>\n<th>编译时安全</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Room Multiplatform</td>\n<td>结构化数据、复杂查询</td>\n<td>Stable（2026）</td>\n<td>SQL 编译时验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DataStore</td>\n<td>键值配置、用户偏好</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>Protocol Buffers schema</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQLDelight</td>\n<td>精细 SQL 控制、迁移</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>SQL 生成 Kotlin 类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Realm Kotlin</td>\n<td>对象型数据库</td>\n<td>Stable</td>\n<td>Schema 编译时检查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"room-multiplatform\">Room Multiplatform</h2><p>Room 从 2.7.0 版本开始正式支持 KMP。它在 iOS 上通过 SQLiter（一个 Kotlin/Native 的 SQLite 绑定）提供底层数据库访问，API 与 Android 上完全一致：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;@Database(entities = [UserEntity::class, NoteEntity::class], version = 2)&#10;abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {&#10;    abstract fun userDao(): UserDao&#10;    abstract fun noteDao(): NoteDao&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Entity(tableName = &quot;users&quot;)&#10;data class UserEntity(&#10;    @PrimaryKey val id: String,&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    val email: String,&#10;    @ColumnInfo(name = &quot;created_at&quot;) val createdAt: Long&#10;)&#10;&#10;@Dao&#10;interface UserDao {&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = :userId&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun getById(userId: String): UserEntity?&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;SELECT * FROM users ORDER BY name ASC&quot;)&#10;    fun observeAll(): Flow&lt;List&lt;UserEntity&gt;&gt;&#10;&#10;    @Upsert&#10;    suspend fun upsert(user: UserEntity)&#10;&#10;    @Query(&quot;DELETE FROM users WHERE id = :userId&quot;)&#10;    suspend fun deleteById(userId: String)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Database(entities = [UserEntity::class, NoteEntity::class], version = 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class AppDatabase : RoomDatabase() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun userDao(): UserDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun noteDao(): NoteDao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity(tableName = \"users\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class UserEntity(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @PrimaryKey val id: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ColumnInfo(name = \"created_at\") val createdAt: Long</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Dao</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserDao {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = :userId\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun getById(userId: String): UserEntity?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"SELECT * FROM users ORDER BY name ASC\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun observeAll(): Flow&#x3C;List&#x3C;UserEntity>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Upsert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun upsert(user: UserEntity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Query(\"DELETE FROM users WHERE id = :userId\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun deleteById(userId: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>平台特定的数据库工厂通过 expect/actual 提供：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;expect fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&lt;AppDatabase&gt;&#10;&#10;// androidMain&#10;actual fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&lt;AppDatabase&gt; {&#10;    return Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, &quot;app.db&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// iosMain&#10;actual fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&lt;AppDatabase&gt; {&#10;    val dbPath = NSHomeDirectory() + &quot;/Documents/app.db&quot;&#10;    return Room.databaseBuilder(dbPath)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>expect fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&#x3C;AppDatabase></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// androidMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&#x3C;AppDatabase> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Room.databaseBuilder(context, AppDatabase::class.java, \"app.db\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// iosMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>actual fun createDatabaseBuilder(context: PlatformContext): RoomDatabase.Builder&#x3C;AppDatabase> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val dbPath = NSHomeDirectory() + \"/Documents/app.db\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return Room.databaseBuilder(dbPath)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"datastore-multiplatform\">DataStore Multiplatform</h2><p>对于简单的键值存储（用户设置、feature flag、缓存令牌），DataStore Preferences 比 SQLite 更轻量：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;val settingsDataStore = PreferenceDataStoreFactory.createWithPath(&#10;    produceFile = { getDataStorePath(&quot;settings.preferences_pb&quot;) }&#10;)&#10;&#10;// 类型安全的键定义&#10;object SettingsKeys {&#10;    val DARK_MODE = booleanPreferencesKey(&quot;dark_mode&quot;)&#10;    val LANGUAGE = stringPreferencesKey(&quot;language&quot;)&#10;    val FONT_SIZE = intPreferencesKey(&quot;font_size&quot;)&#10;    val LAST_SYNC = longPreferencesKey(&quot;last_sync_timestamp&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 读取（响应式）&#10;val darkModeFlow: Flow&lt;Boolean&gt; = settingsDataStore.data&#10;    .map { prefs -&gt; prefs[SettingsKeys.DARK_MODE] ?: false }&#10;&#10;// 写入&#10;suspend fun setDarkMode(enabled: Boolean) {&#10;    settingsDataStore.edit { prefs -&gt;&#10;        prefs[SettingsKeys.DARK_MODE] = enabled&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val settingsDataStore = PreferenceDataStoreFactory.createWithPath(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    produceFile = { getDataStorePath(\"settings.preferences_pb\") }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 类型安全的键定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object SettingsKeys {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val DARK_MODE = booleanPreferencesKey(\"dark_mode\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val LANGUAGE = stringPreferencesKey(\"language\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val FONT_SIZE = intPreferencesKey(\"font_size\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val LAST_SYNC = longPreferencesKey(\"last_sync_timestamp\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 读取（响应式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val darkModeFlow: Flow&#x3C;Boolean> = settingsDataStore.data</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .map { prefs -> prefs[SettingsKeys.DARK_MODE] ?: false }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 写入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>suspend fun setDarkMode(enabled: Boolean) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    settingsDataStore.edit { prefs -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        prefs[SettingsKeys.DARK_MODE] = enabled</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DataStore 的优势在于：基于 Kotlin 协程和 Flow 的异步 API（无主线程阻塞风险）、原子读写（不会出现读到半写状态）、以及 Protocol Buffers 模式下的类型化 schema。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据库迁移策略\">数据库迁移策略</h2><p>跨平台项目的数据库迁移比单平台更复杂——同一份迁移逻辑必须在 Android SQLite 和 iOS SQLiter 上都正确执行：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;val MIGRATION_1_2 = object : Migration(1, 2) {&#10;    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {&#10;        db.execSQL(&quot;ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN avatar_url TEXT DEFAULT NULL&quot;)&#10;        db.execSQL(&quot;CREATE INDEX idx_users_email ON users(email)&quot;)&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;val database = createDatabaseBuilder(context)&#10;    .addMigrations(MIGRATION_1_2)&#10;    .fallbackToDestructiveMigration()  // 开发期回退策略&#10;    .build()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val MIGRATION_1_2 = object : Migration(1, 2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun migrate(db: SupportSQLiteDatabase) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.execSQL(\"ALTER TABLE users ADD COLUMN avatar_url TEXT DEFAULT NULL\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        db.execSQL(\"CREATE INDEX idx_users_email ON users(email)\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val database = createDatabaseBuilder(context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .addMigrations(MIGRATION_1_2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .fallbackToDestructiveMigration()  // 开发期回退策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .build()</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    V1[Schema v1] --&gt;|MIGRATION_1_2| V2[Schema v2]&#10;    V2 --&gt;|MIGRATION_2_3| V3[Schema v3]&#10;    V1 --&gt;|fallbackToDestructiveMigration| V3\">flowchart LR\n    V1[Schema v1] --&gt;|MIGRATION_1_2| V2[Schema v2]\n    V2 --&gt;|MIGRATION_2_3| V3[Schema v3]\n    V1 --&gt;|fallbackToDestructiveMigration| V3</pre><p>迁移测试是关键——在 <code>commonTest</code> 中验证迁移 SQL 的正确性：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonTest&#10;@Test&#10;fun migration1To2_addsAvatarColumn() = runTest {&#10;    val db = createInMemoryDatabase(version = 1)&#10;    db.execSQL(&quot;INSERT INTO users (id, name, email, created_at) VALUES (&#39;1&#39;, &#39;Alice&#39;, &#39;a@b.com&#39;, 0)&quot;)&#10;&#10;    MIGRATION_1_2.migrate(db)&#10;&#10;    val cursor = db.query(&quot;SELECT avatar_url FROM users WHERE id = &#39;1&#39;&quot;)&#10;    assertTrue(cursor.moveToFirst())&#10;    assertNull(cursor.getString(0))&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonTest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun migration1To2_addsAvatarColumn() = runTest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val db = createInMemoryDatabase(version = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    db.execSQL(\"INSERT INTO users (id, name, email, created_at) VALUES ('1', 'Alice', 'a@b.com', 0)\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    MIGRATION_1_2.migrate(db)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cursor = db.query(\"SELECT avatar_url FROM users WHERE id = '1'\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertTrue(cursor.moveToFirst())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assertNull(cursor.getString(0))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"离线优先架构\">离线优先架构</h2><p>将网络层和持久化层结合，实现离线优先（Offline-First）的数据同步模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>实现方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cache-First</td>\n<td>列表数据、搜索结果</td>\n<td>先展示本地缓存，后台刷新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network-First</td>\n<td>实时性要求高的数据</td>\n<td>先请求网络，失败回退本地</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stale-While-Revalidate</td>\n<td>用户资料、配置</td>\n<td>立即展示缓存+异步更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// commonMain&#10;class OfflineFirstUserRepository(&#10;    private val api: UserApi,&#10;    private val dao: UserDao,&#10;    private val settings: DataStore&lt;Preferences&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    fun observeUser(id: String): Flow&lt;User&gt; = flow {&#10;        // 1. 先发射本地缓存&#10;        dao.getById(id)?.let { emit(it.toDomain()) }&#10;&#10;        // 2. 尝试网络刷新&#10;        val remote = safeApiCall { api.getUser(id) }&#10;        remote.onSuccess { user -&gt;&#10;            dao.upsert(user.toEntity())&#10;            emit(user)&#10;        }&#10;    }.distinctUntilChanged()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// commonMain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OfflineFirstUserRepository(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val api: UserApi,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val dao: UserDao,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val settings: DataStore&#x3C;Preferences></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun observeUser(id: String): Flow&#x3C;User> = flow {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 1. 先发射本地缓存</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        dao.getById(id)?.let { emit(it.toDomain()) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 2. 尝试网络刷新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val remote = safeApiCall { api.getUser(id) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        remote.onSuccess { user -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            dao.upsert(user.toEntity())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            emit(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }.distinctUntilChanged()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Room Multiplatform 是 2026 年 KMP 结构化持久化的首选，API 跨平台一致</li>\n<li>DataStore 处理键值/配置存储，原生异步、原子写入</li>\n<li>数据库迁移在 commonMain 定义一次，在所有平台执行——必须做迁移测试</li>\n<li>离线优先架构将网络和持久化组合为统一的数据源</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"multiplatform-networking\">跨平台网络与序列化</a>——网络层获取的数据如何落地</li>\n<li><a href=\"expect-actual-mechanism\">expect/actual 机制</a>——数据库工厂的平台适配</li>\n<li><a href=\"../android-development/architecture-components/room-database\">Android 开发：Room 数据库</a>——Room 在纯 Android 项目中的完整用法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"跨平台持久化","id":"跨平台持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Room Multiplatform","id":"room-multiplatform"},{"level":2,"text":"DataStore Multiplatform","id":"datastore-multiplatform"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库迁移策略","id":"数据库迁移策略"},{"level":2,"text":"离线优先架构","id":"离线优先架构"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"跨平台网络与序列化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/shared-logic/multiplatform-networking"},"next":{"title":"Compose Multiplatform 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-multiplatform/ui/compose-multiplatform-fundamentals"}}